---
// Parked, not retired. This case study was unpublished on 2026-08-20 at the
// merchant's request pending their approval to republish.
//
// Why a real page instead of a redirect: Astro's `redirects` config emits an
// instant meta refresh plus a canonical pointing at the destination, which
// Google reads as "this URL is permanently gone, fold it into that one".
// Base.astro emits a SELF-canonical plus `noindex, nofollow` instead, so the
// URL is held in place without consolidating its equity anywhere.
//
// To republish: set draft:false on the post, move the images back from
// archive/anti-aging-case-study/img/, and delete this file.
// See archive/anti-aging-case-study/README.md.
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Case study unavailable"
  description="This case study is not currently available."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-24 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
      This case study isn't available
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
      We've taken it offline. The argument behind it is still up, and it's the
      better read anyway.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8">
      <a
        class="font-semibold underline decoration-slate-300 hover:decoration-slate-600"
        href="/quiz-funnels-vs-collection-pages-why-your-paid-traffic-bounces/"
      >
        Quiz funnels vs collection pages: why your paid traffic bounces
      </a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
      Or browse <a class="underline" href="/blog/">the blog</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
